[
  {
    "RowId": 44694,
    "Text": "For my next feat, let's turn up the heat!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44695,
    "Text": "You've no recourse but to cower before my <i>true</i> power!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44696,
    "Text": "Before we're through, you'll learn there's nothing I can't do!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44697,
    "Text": "Refuse to obey and I'll make you pay!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44698,
    "Text": "No matter where you run, I'll still have my fun!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44699,
    "Text": "My patience is through─and now so are you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44700,
    "Text": "My patience is through─and now so are you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44701,
    "Text": "I shall snuff your flame out─another swift rout!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44702,
    "Text": "Ohoho! You catch on fast!\nJust like a pupil from my past!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44703,
    "Text": "Ohoho! Too slow, I fear!\nYou never stood a chance, my dear!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44704,
    "Text": "You've proven a match for my magicked doll... Perhaps you have merit, after all."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44705,
    "Text": "Have care! There's no telling what she'll conjure next."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44706,
    "Text": "Dammit! Is everyone all right?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44707,
    "Text": "A comrade is down, but we mustn't give up! Quickly─someone revive them!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44708,
    "Text": "I fear we'll not survive this without powerful healing magicks."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44709,
    "Text": "Ohohoho!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44710,
    "Text": "Who... Who calleth my name...?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44711,
    "Text": "We stand now before the very father of creation... Hold nothing back."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44712,
    "Text": "Yearn... Desire... Hunger...for the end of mortality."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44713,
    "Text": "Desire...for the Emptiness..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44714,
    "Text": "A fate...decided..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44715,
    "Text": "O darkness..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44716,
    "Text": "Bear unto them...my essence..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44717,
    "Text": "O star...descend from the heavens...I beseech thee..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44718,
    "Text": "O Altana, I beg your grace once more."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44719,
    "Text": "Thine arrogant heart shall be mine..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44720,
    "Text": "This place is... It's been swallowed by the Emptiness, the darkness of man's heart made manifest."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44721,
    "Text": "So long as I hold faith in my comrades, and they in me, darkness shall find no purchase in my heart."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44722,
    "Text": "The reign of Twilight is inevitable..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44723,
    "Text": "Thine own weakness betrays thee..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44724,
    "Text": "It's taking the darkness into itself!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44725,
    "Text": "Our farewell shall be...forever."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44726,
    "Text": "The Twilight God could never... What has Sareel Ja done?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44727,
    "Text": "What in the world?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44728,
    "Text": "The Emptiness threatens to spread."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44729,
    "Text": "Careful, lest the darkness take you."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44730,
    "Text": "A perfect death...denied...\nThe vessel...must needs...be filled..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44731,
    "Text": "He means to use the darkness in my heart against us!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44732,
    "Text": "What are you plotting, witch!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44800,
    "Text": "Our brotherbond is unbreakable!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44801,
    "Text": "Now! We war together!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44802,
    "Text": "Hrhhh... Hrhhh... HRAAAGGGHHH!!!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44803,
    "Text": "We'll windknock you from the ground up!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44804,
    "Text": "My sword is as sharp as my tongueflaps!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44805,
    "Text": "Leave Chewchum Popoto alone, you cheatsneak!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44806,
    "Text": "Chewchum Popoto! Are you all right!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44807,
    "Text": "<i>Now</i> you're asking for it!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44808,
    "Text": "Dodgedance my blastbombs!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44809,
    "Text": "I-I'm not nervous! <i>You're</i> nervous!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44810,
    "Text": "Lend me your strength, Chewchum Popoto!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44900,
    "Text": "Obey me, daughter of man!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44901,
    "Text": "Thy blades to do my bidding."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44902,
    "Text": "All of creation─mine to wield!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44903,
    "Text": "No escape. <i>Beastmaster</i>."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44904,
    "Text": "By steel, thy flesh be seared!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44905,
    "Text": "Ghhhrrrhhh! Die... DIE!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 44906,
    "Text": "My forest... My kindred... All shall be avenged!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45100,
    "Text": "Prove your strength with answers true."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45101,
    "Text": "What knowledge have you of numbers?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45102,
    "Text": "How mighty is your memory?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45103,
    "Text": "Riddle me this─which child is kin of cloud?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45104,
    "Text": "Riddle me this─which child is kin of scale?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45105,
    "Text": "Riddle me this─which child is kin of beast?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45106,
    "Text": "Riddle me this─which child is kin of wave?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45107,
    "Text": "Forsooth. Aread me right and fortune yields its blessings."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45108,
    "Text": "Amiss. Aread me false and punishment awaits."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45109,
    "Text": "Your strength has been proven."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45110,
    "Text": "Time to brawl, kupo! Bring it on!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45111,
    "Text": "You won't stand a chance against our magicks! Poms away!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45112,
    "Text": "Pull yourselves together! Pompile them if you have to, just <i>win</i>, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45113,
    "Text": "May our bonded souls prove true. Have at thee!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45114,
    "Text": "You shall not escape my blades!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45115,
    "Text": "Never have I felt so free... Free to reign supreme!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45116,
    "Text": "Mine is a terrible power... Forget not our former shackles."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45117,
    "Text": "Guttler, fire for our steel!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45118,
    "Text": "Partake of my might, Lauda. Fell our foes!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45119,
    "Text": "Our spirits flicker... Nay, let them kindle anew!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45120,
    "Text": "The path Guttler and I have chosen... It shall not end here!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45121,
    "Text": "Can you detect the invisible?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45122,
    "Text": "Five seconds remain."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45123,
    "Text": "Four..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45124,
    "Text": "Three..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45125,
    "Text": "Two..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45126,
    "Text": "One..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45127,
    "Text": "I cannot deny your strength...but neither shall I forfeit!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45128,
    "Text": "Riddle me this─where do evens lie?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45129,
    "Text": "Riddle me this─wherein lie the odds?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45130,
    "Text": "Riddle me this─what can threes divide?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45131,
    "Text": "Riddle me this─which numbers are in prime?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45132,
    "Text": "Make your choice. Care not to err."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45200,
    "Text": "What are these creatures...?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45201,
    "Text": "They are <i>clearly</i> not wild animals!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45202,
    "Text": "Questions can wait till after the battle!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45203,
    "Text": "Ready for another round?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45204,
    "Text": "Of course. Leave the healing to me."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45205,
    "Text": "Enough. Have at you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45206,
    "Text": "They're up to something. Be ready!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45207,
    "Text": "I shall fortify our defenses!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45208,
    "Text": "What are they playing at?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45209,
    "Text": "Let him go!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45210,
    "Text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45211,
    "Text": "'Tis curious, though... They made no attempt to strike us while we were bound."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45212,
    "Text": "Could it be...their true objective is our capture?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45213,
    "Text": "What now..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45214,
    "Text": "It appears the onslaught has halted..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45215,
    "Text": "I'll watch your backs from here! Do as I say and you'll be fine!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45216,
    "Text": "She does seem to know what she's doing..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45217,
    "Text": "There's a surge in water energies! Keep your distance!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45218,
    "Text": "It's harnessing water!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45219,
    "Text": "Get clear before it bursts!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45220,
    "Text": "Look out! Those water orbs are going to fall!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45221,
    "Text": "Be careful how they bounce!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45222,
    "Text": "This concentration of magic... Quickly, get back!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45223,
    "Text": "You do not want to be caught in that!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45224,
    "Text": "They're trying to bind us again!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45225,
    "Text": "Oh no you don't!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45226,
    "Text": "Thank you for the timely aid!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45227,
    "Text": "Deal with the big one! I'll handle the rest!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45228,
    "Text": "It's...siphoning the isle's aether!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45229,
    "Text": "It's gathering power! Throw everything you have at its heart!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45230,
    "Text": "Hmph. This calls for a heavier hand."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45231,
    "Text": "Unleash your rage, Nidhogg!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45232,
    "Text": "Yes, it's reeling! Now's your chance!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45233,
    "Text": "Down with you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45234,
    "Text": "Defeat the hostile creatures!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45235,
    "Text": "More of them..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45300,
    "Text": "All who dare oppose me shall quake before the silken Dark..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45301,
    "Text": "Perish."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45302,
    "Text": "The void's power is mine to wield."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45303,
    "Text": "You have no place here."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45304,
    "Text": "Accept your downfall."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45305,
    "Text": "Struggle is futile."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45306,
    "Text": "And thus did all boundaries cease to be."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45307,
    "Text": "Be still."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45308,
    "Text": "Doth the yawning rift not tempt you?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45309,
    "Text": "Behold the truth of this world!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45310,
    "Text": "The void consumes..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45311,
    "Text": "Naught will endure..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45312,
    "Text": "Neither past nor future..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45313,
    "Text": "Only one certainty remains..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45314,
    "Text": "My triumph!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45315,
    "Text": "I've breached the darkness! Let the Light guide you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45316,
    "Text": "You must break free!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45317,
    "Text": "The underlings are no more. Now to deal with Enuo!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45318,
    "Text": "Life and death rendered meaningless..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45319,
    "Text": "Such is the power of the void!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45320,
    "Text": "I will not yield my domain!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45321,
    "Text": "Light protect us!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45322,
    "Text": "The void shall never cease to be!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45323,
    "Text": "My power is absolute!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45324,
    "Text": "Embrace the emptiness beyond Light and Dark."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45325,
    "Text": "Succumb to eternal silence!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45400,
    "Text": "Let the feast begin!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45401,
    "Text": "Come, my fair sisters! Entertain our guests."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45402,
    "Text": "Feed me... Let me drink deep of your essence..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45403,
    "Text": "Yield to your yearning..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 45404,
    "Text": "Love is the sweetest poison, is it not?"
  },
